aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.SUBSTEP.short = Place
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.SUBSTEP.hint = Placement blocks are added to your inventory for each step. Place or click the needed blocks and spots inside the footprint. Right-click a placed spot to remove it.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.MATERIALS.title = Build materials
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.MATERIALS.short = Materials
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.MATERIALS.hint = Press F to open the build materials menu. Prefab fill adds costs without giving you items.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.MATERIALS.detail = Use plus and minus to change counts. Add from inventory copies counts into the list and returns your items.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.title = Building settings
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.short = Settings
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.hint = Enter the display name, description, building id, and tags. Set treasury gold cost, self build days, style, prefab empty spaces, plot token lock, and optionally submit to the community marketplace. The id updates from the name until you edit the id field yourself. The prefab file uses this id.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.detail = Gold is paid from the town treasury when the plot is built. Self build days is how long the plot takes to finish without a building staff. Style groups your building in the plot crafting bench. Save empty spaces controls whether air in your footprint is saved to clear blocks when built. Plot token locked requires players to unlock this plot at the plot crafting bench before they can craft tokens.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.selfBuildDays = Self-build days (game days)
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.maxHomeResidents = Max residents (1-8)

aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.saveEmptySpaces = Save empty spaces in prefab
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.saveEmptySpaces.hint = When on, air in your footprint is saved and clears those blocks when the building is assembled. When off, only solid blocks are saved and existing terrain is kept. Editor empty markers always clear blocks.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.preserveWater = Keep water when building
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.preserveWater.hint = When on, water stays in prefab air spaces outside the build. Editor empty markers still clear water so you can hollow out interiors.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.touristDestination = Visitors may stop here
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.touristDestination.hint = When on, portal visitors may walk to this building during the day.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.hint.closeConfigurePanelFirst = Press Done on the building settings panel before continuing.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.plotTokenLocked = Plot token locked by default
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.plotTokenLocked.hint = When on, players must spend an unlock point at the plot crafting bench before they can craft plot tokens for this building.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.styleId = Style
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.styleId.hint = Any name you like

